//! Every data marker the ICU4X data crates in the lock carry, by crate
//! (`icu_datetime_data` and the rest, at the versions the workspace pins):
//! the macro each crate exports to implement it and the marker's type, as
//! the crate's own `data/` files name them, the markers keyed by locale
//! apart from those with one entry for every locale. [`crate::Compiled`]
//! implements all of them from the compiled data, so an export holds every
//! marker a `compiled_data` constructor can ask for. Moving the ICU4X
//! crates to another release regenerates this list from their `data/`
//! files.
//!
//! Left out: the markers whose types only a feature this workspace doesn't
//! turn on declares, so no component asks for them: `icu_locale`'s
//! `unstable` locale display names (`locale_names_*`) and `icu_plurals`'
//! ranges (`plurals_ranges_v1`).

/// Calls `$then!` with the markers keyed by locale, then, after `;`, those
/// with one entry, each as `crate::implement => type,`.
